    "body": " https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/13780\n\nIn Chromium and WebKit, `auto` is the canonical keyword. Gecko doesn't have a canonical keyword.\n\nThe `popover` attribute also has the same issue.\n\nThe only other attribute I found with multiple keywords for one state and limited to known values is https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#cors-settings-attribute which uses `auto` as the canonical keyword.\n\nI think we should use `auto`.",
