    "created_at": "2025-05-13T10:53:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-05-13T10:53:06Z",
    "body": "I wonder if we could further refine the rules to also ignore the empty string keyword if that is one of several conforming keywords mapping to the same state. That way it's more likely to be consistent going forward.",
